for themselves.</span></div></div><div id="ic28" class="clip icon" data-start="26.295" data-duration="1.496" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:475px;top:1214px;width:130px;height:130px"><img src="assets/icons/png/people.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap29" class="clip cap" data-start="27.811" data-duration="2.156" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1000px"><div class="ln capw" id="cap29-0"><div class="bwin" style="font-size:92px" data-layout-allow-occlusion data-layout-allow-overlap><span class="rgb r" data-layout-allow-occlusion>ONE TEAM STORE,</span><span class="rgb c" data-layout-allow-occlusion>ONE TEAM STORE,</span><span class="gfill">ONE TEAM STORE,</span></div></div><div class="ln it" id="cap29-1" style="font-size:83.5px">one link,</div></div><div id="ic30" class="clip icon" data-start="28.111" data-duration="1.856" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:475px;top:1224px;width:130px;height:130px"><img src="assets/icons/png/store.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap31" class="clip cap" data-start="29.987" data-duration="1.475" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1000px"><div class="ln" id="cap31-0" style="font-size:83.5px">shipped to</div><div class="ln it" id="cap31-1" style="font-size:83.5px"><span class="grn">each player&#x27;s door.</span></div></div><div id="ic32" class="clip icon" data-start="30.037" data-duration="1.425" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:475px;top:1214px;width:130px;height:130px"><img src="assets/icons/png/truck.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap33" class="clip cap" data-start="31.482" data-duration="1.980" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1000px"><div class="ln" id="cap33-0" style="font-size:83.5px">Nobody sorting boxes</div><div class="ln it" id="cap33-1" style="font-size:83.5px">in their garage,</div></div><div id="ic34" class="clip icon" data-start="32.112" data-duration="1.350" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:475px;top:1214px;width:130px;height:130px"><img src="assets/icons/png/box.p